{"id":"5134","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5134_main_stratus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>碎层云以不规则、粗糙的云状碎片的形式出现，其轮廓不断变化并且经常迅速变化。在这张图片中，碎层云是在降水性积雨云下面潮湿的湍流空气中形成。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span> 处的积雨云的深色底部下方可以清楚地看到不规则的碎片。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Chun Fook Tin","location":"中国台湾省基隆市附近","latitude":"纬度: 25° 8' 9'' N","longitude":"经度: 121° 49' 29'' E","date":"02 June 2016 0800 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.11"}]}]}